WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.690
A comet from another star.

00:02.493 --> 00:04.710
This one does not belong to the Sun at all.

00:05.181 --> 00:09.788
It is called Borisov, after the amateur astronomer who found it in 2019.

00:10.245 --> 00:15.270
Its speed and its path show that it came from another star, and it is leaving for good.

00:15.849 --> 00:18.068
Three such visitors have been seen so far.
